(
    title: "Elk Attack",
    developer: Some("Mark R. Hahn"),
    description: Some("An unreleased 1987 port of Taito\'s The Electric Yo-Yo!, wearing a joke title its programmer never expected to keep: your yo-yo flings its string across an open board of coloured blocks, reeling you block to block as you clear them, while worm-like creatures harry the line and power squares buy speed and brief invincibility. The port drops the arcade\'s indestructible roaming enemy, leaving it too forgiving — the stated reason Atari passed on it."),
